## Model card

- **Name:** MiMo V2.6 Free
- **Short description:** Xiaomi’s MiMo V2.6 Free is described in local metadata as the OpenCode Zen $0 free-tier lane for MiMo V2.6 Flash-class capability, with capped context/output on the free tier and paid fallback options.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen free tier and Xiaomi MiMo paid fallback (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/mimo-v2-6-free`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `mimo-v2.6-free` (OpenCode lane; underlying model lineage referenced to MiMo V2.6 Flash in metadata).
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M; 128K out) per local metadata, with free-lane caps noted in description (200K/32K cap).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free Zen tier $0 in/out; paid fallback $0.14/$0.28 per 1M (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Local metadata describes MIT 309B/15B-active Flash MoE; not independently verified from accessible official sources in this pass.

